#
# Defines the Traversable marker interface, which serves as a base contract
# indicating that a type supports some form of sequential element traversal.
# Types implementing Traversable signal that their elements can be visited
# in order, though the specific traversal mechanism is left to subtypes
# such as Iterable or Iterator.
